# PR assignee

Until the project has more maintainers, **always assign `@Sinedrone-Sentinel`** when creating a GitHub pull request (`gh pr create --assignee Sinedrone-Sentinel`, or `gh pr edit --add-assignee Sinedrone-Sentinel` if create omitted it).

Do this for every PR opened in this repo unless the user names a different assignee.
